- * asked for. Bounded; the oldest answer goes first.
+ * asked for. Bounded per app, so that one app that resolves thousands of names cannot push the
+ * answers of another app out; within an app the oldest unread answer goes first. An IPv4 address is
+ * the same address in its plain and in its mapped IPv6 form. The names of a user are forgotten when
